You could try it blindly: Type 'O' 'L' 'Enter' "Times" 'Enter'; then, you
should have set the menu font to Times and you can proceed from there.
(The other fonts are 'M', 'R', 'S'; sizes are 'N' to 'Q'.)

Are you sure that NetHack is reading your defaults.nh at all? Introduce
some errors and see whether you get diagnostic messages upon starting
NetHack.

